From: boxed-pi <boxed-pi@localhost>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 16:45:01 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/4] Add portal cube racetrack verification map (--map
 racetrack)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

set_up_portal_cube_racetrack_map: two self-running exhibits where every
cube loops forever so crossings repeat indefinitely — a four-corner
racetrack of one-way 90° portals (three fast cubes put a corner crossing
on screen every ~2.4s; one slow cube straddles each face long enough to
watch the poke-through rendering), and a vertical 180°-flip shuttle
showing velocity reversal and the one-way exit tail. Selectable via
--map <demo|racetrack> (do_everything now takes a map name; default
game unchanged) or ./maps/racetrack.sh. Lap-closure tests prove the
loops close exactly at both a single multi-crossing tick and the real
21ms frame cadence.
